  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given $t_{1 / 2}=3$ Total time $\\mathrm{T}=12$\r\n\r\nNo. of half lives $(n)=\\frac{12}{3}=4$ $\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{n}=\\frac{\\mathrm{N}}{\\mathrm{N}_{\\mathrm{o}}} \r\n\r\n\\therefore\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{4}=\\frac{3}{\\mathrm{~N}}$\r\n\r\n$\\frac{3}{\\mathrm{~N}}=\\frac{1}{16}$\r\n\r\n$N=48$",
    "image": null
  },
